diff --git a/changelog/70129.added.md b/changelog/70129.added.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..787dfc2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/70129.added.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+Added ``beacons.status`` to query, per beacon, the last time it actually
+fired and whether that firing raised an error. Status is tracked live by
+the running minion process as beacons execute, so it reflects real
+activity immediately without waiting for a new probe cycle, reading log
+files, or restarting the minion. Beacons that are configured but have not
+fired yet are reported with ``last_fired: None`` rather than a stale or
+made-up value.
